&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough code reviews, raising the bar on code quality, readability, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools to accelerate development velocity while maintaining high standards for security, correctness, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and document team standards for AI usage (prompt patterns, code review checklists, validation strategies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to an early stage product environment, unblocking others and taking initiative where processes are still being defined&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 6 years experience and/or operating at Senior/Staff level building highly scalable, production systems — whether that&#39;s user-facing web applications in modern JavaScript/TypeScript and React, or backend services in a language like Go, Java or Python. If you&#39;re frontend-strong, you don&#39;t need to arrive fluent in Go — just curious about what&#39;s happening beneath the UI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in React architecture, component-driven development, and modern state management patterns, libraries like NextJS, TanStack Query, Tailwind, Zustand — or, on the backend, experience with data modeling and event-driven architecture (e.g. Postgres, Kafka/PubSub)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of your primary language&#39;s features, idioms, and best practices (JavaScript/TypeScript or a backend language), with the ability to influence team standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of performance and reliability — responsive design, accessibility, and web standards on the front end; scalability, observability, and correctness on the backend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating with backend APIs and collaborating with cross-functional platform/infra teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines, testing strategies, and safe deployment practices for web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-first mentality, with a willingness to do what it takes to get the job done and a desire to strive for better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI tools (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Copilot, etc.) to ship production code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can demonstrate specific examples of workflow improvements (e.g., &quot;reduced boilerplate generation time by 40%&quot;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively communicates complex technical concepts clearly to diverse audiences, including engineers and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a high-growth environment where priorities evolve regularly and decisions are made quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to collaborate cross-functionally across diverse teams within large enterprise environments, supporting alignment and shared success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You don&#39;t need to tick every box — strength in one area and a willingness to learn goes a long way.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in early-stage or high-growth startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source projects or technical community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-money transaction systems and regulatory compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in building developer tools or improving engineering productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading without authority and influencing technical direction across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc in Computer Science or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connections and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to build the future of sports trading? If you possess some of these skills but not all of them, we still encourage you to apply! Please note that visa sponsorship is not available for this position. We are open to fully remote candidates based in the United Kingdom. Remote employees may also be eligible for a home office setup stipend.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fanatics Markets:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Markets is the real-money prediction and trading app where you can invest in moments you care about. Built on a secure platform, we let users predict real-world outcomes and trade on events they actually follow - from sports and entertainment to political elections and beyond. Our mission is to redefine how fans engage with the moments and markets that matter most. We&#39;re looking for the right people to help us build the future of prediction markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics recently acquired a CFTC-registered Designated Contract Market and Derivatives Clearing Organisation, giving Fanatics Markets its own fully regulated exchange and clearinghouse infrastructure. We are now building the engineering team that will run it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This Senior Software Engineer (Backend) role sits at the heart of that build. You will have significant ownership over the core exchange platform, working on the systems that power order processing, market data distribution, trade lifecycle management and regulatory reporting for a CFTC-regulated exchange. The engineering challenges are those of any serious regulated trading environment, high-availability, low-latency, mission-critical infrastructure, but built for a consumer audience with the reach and distribution of Fanatics behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining a team modernising an existing Java codebase and building new services in Java, working alongside engineers with deep backgrounds in regulated financial infrastructure. You will be joining a team with a clear ambition: to bring this platform to the bleeding edge of financial infrastructure. This is not a clean slate but the technical ambition is real, and engineers who join now will have a level of architectural influence and ownership that is hard to find anywhere else.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are pioneering the use of AI as a code collaborator. We need engineers who have gone beyond experimentation and who actively use Claude Code, Codex, GitHub Copilot, or similar tools to ship production code faster while maintaining exceptional quality standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, development, testing, and deployment of high-performance, fault-tolerant distributed backend services supporting the FMX exchange platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own services and features end-to-end: spec writing, implementation, instrumentation, deployment, monitoring, and iteration based on metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within and help modernise the existing Java codebase while contributing to new service development in Java and potentially Kotlin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the architecture for order processing, market data distribution, and trade lifecycle management on a CFTC-regulated exchange.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reliable daily reporting pipelines, ensuring data integrity and full audit trails across all trading activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in 24/7 on-call rotations, contribute to SLO definition, alerting strategy, and incident response for mission-critical trading infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model and manage data for contracts, orders, positions, and settlements with an emphasis on correctness, integrity, and regulatory auditability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the DevOps/Platform team to ensure services are observable, scalable, and compliant with MNPI and insider trading restrictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough code reviews, raising the bar on code quality, readability, security, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools to accelerate development velocity while maintaining high standards for security, correctness, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and document team standards for AI usage, prompt patterns, code review checklists, and validation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a fast-paced environment, unblocking others and taking initiative where processes are still being defined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building highly scalable, high-performance backend applications or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in regulated exchange or financial infrastructure strongly preferred, brokerage, futures or derivatives exchanges (e.g. CBOE, CME, ICE), market makers, or hedge funds with relevant trading infrastructure experience, or similar CFTC/SEC-regulated environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong production experience with Java; Kotlin experience a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven architectures (Kafka, Kinesis, PubSub, or similar) in a financial or high-throughput context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data integrity and transaction management in PostgreSQL or equivalent RDBMS, including financial-grade data modelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp of software design principles (SOLID, DRY) and testing methodologies (unit, integration, end-to-end).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CFTC compliance requirements, MNPI handling, and audit trail obligations in a regulated trading environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines, automated testing, and safe deployment practices for backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production reliability experience: monitoring, logging, alerting, on-call, and SLO definition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI tools (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, etc.) to ship production code; able to articulate specific workflow improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates complex technical concepts clearly to engineering, compliance, and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-paced, high-growth environment where priorities evolve and decisions are made quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience at a US-regulated financial exchange or licensed trading platform (e.g. CBOE, CME, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with low-latency trading systems, order book design, or market data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with low-latency in-memory systems and the performance engineering techniques required to operate them at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Aeron or similar high-performance messaging frameworks used in financial trading environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience modernising legacy Java codebases in a financial services context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in a high-growth or scale-up environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source projects or the technical community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE, a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connections and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to build the future of regulated prediction markets? If you possess some of these skills but not all of them, we still encourage you to apply! Please note that visa sponsorship is not available for this position. We are open to fully remote candidates based in the United Kingdom. Remote employees may also be eligible for a home office setup stipend.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics is building Fanatics Markets, and is aiming to be the biggest and best prediction market for Sports and Sports Culture. As part of that growth, we’re looking for a Senior Product Manager to help define and drive the product experience for our prediction markets platform. This is a hands-on, execution-focused role for someone who leads with data, takes full ownership of their area, and knows how to ship. You’ll work closely with engineering, design, growth, and commercial teams to define what we build, prioritise ruthlessly, and make sure it lands. This role reports into Louis Sutton, our VP of Product, where you’ll be apart of a small and high performing product and design team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Senior Product Manager, you’ll own the product roadmap for your area, from problem discovery to execution and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll define success for what you ship, and drive the team to achieve that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work with Design, Data and Engineering to ensure you’re solving the most important problem in your domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll articulate strategy, priorities, tradeoffs and own your own success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of product management experience in consumer-facing digital products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerically strong, you know how to use data to make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve shipped products end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a high ownership mentality, and you treat problems as yours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a clear concise communicator (written and verbal)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in fast-moving, ambiguous environments; able to balance pace with quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re AI native, and love using Claude (or whatever tool you prefer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, sports, gaming or other fast paced consumer facing digital products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a user of prediction markets, sportsbooks or other comparative products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ranges will change based on country and state of residence, which are reflected in Geographical Zones defined by Fanatics Betting and Gaming. The range incorporates all of our Geographical Compensation Zones and is subject to change as the Zone associated with the actual offer is confirmed. In addition to the base and bonus, full-time employment, and more. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£70,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£93,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.organization-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Launched in 2021, Fanatics Betting and Gaming is the online and retail sports betting subsidiary of Fanatics, a global digital sports platform. The Fanatics Sportsbook is available to 95% of the addressable online sports bettor market in the U.S. Fanatics Casino is currently available online in Michigan, New Jersey, Pennsylvania and West Virginia. Fanatics Betting and Gaming operates twenty-two retail sports betting locations, including the only sportsbook inside an NFL stadium at Northwest Stadium. Fanatics Betting and Gaming is headquartered in New York with offices in Denver, Leeds and Dublin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Campaign Operations Manager is a pivotal role responsible for taking operational delivery across CRM, Promotional Operations and Front-End Content &amp;amp; Merchandising to a new standard, giving the business and senior leadership genuine confidence in what&#39;s being built, executed and delivered across every owned channel and touchpoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re hands on enough to troubleshoot live platforms and lead incident response the moment a campaign or promotion needs it, with an eagle-eyed view across everything live and everything coming next. You lead people the same way you lead delivery: coaching the team to raise their own standards, not just directing their work, and setting benchmarks the wider function can build on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at the intersection of CRM, Operations and Product, this role is central to Fanatics&#39; ambition to become the #1 Online US Casino by 2030.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery Accountability &amp;amp; Operational Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold end-to-end accountability for the operational running of campaign, promotion and front end content delivery across the team, ensuring all requirements from Commercial, Analytics, Product and Engineering are in place from approved brief through build, QA, deployment, monitoring and post-launch review.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a complete, eagle-eyed view of delivery status, live risk and upcoming critical moments, keeping the campaign calendar, dependencies and escalation paths accurate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold the team accountable for quality and timeliness, stepping in directly when delivery or player experience is at risk, and surfacing systemic risk that needs action beyond a single workstream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Management &amp;amp; Operational Resilience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own on-call coverage and incident response for live campaigns, promotions and content, acting as the senior operational escalation point when delivery or execution risk surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot platform and execution issues hands on, coordinating containment, stakeholder communications, recovery and post incident follow up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own root-cause resolution, escalating platform-level causes to the CRM &amp;amp; Promotions Enablement Lead where needed and driving corrective action on recurring or high-severity incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the severity levels, playbooks and launch monitoring checklists that keep incident response consistent and repeatable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standards, Governance &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set standards for campaign and content setup, audience selection, offer eligibility, testing, deployment and monitoring across owned channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the operational QA and release readiness gate that live activity must clear before launch, in partnership with Commercial, Legal, Compliance and Product, ensuring responsible gaming, privacy and jurisdictional requirements are met with clear audit trails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the change controls, access permissions and documentation required for consistent, compliant and continuously improving execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Capability Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and develop the team, setting clear objectives, decision rights, performance expectations, and a benchmark for operational excellence that others are equipped to meet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build capability and confidence across the function through hands-on coaching, playbooks and structured knowledge sharing, rather than direction alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a culture of ownership and continuous improvement, where risks and mistakes are surfaced early and addressed constructively, and close capability or resourcing gaps as they emerge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with CRM Planning on the campaign roadmap, upcoming plans and capacity signals so operational readiness is built in early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the critical interface into Customer Support and VIP, briefing them on upcoming activity, equipping them to resolve player escalations, and feeding recurring friction points back into delivery standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent operational readiness and delivery risk in cross functional planning for new campaigns, promotions, content and platform capabilities, connecting operational performance to player experience and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in CRM, campaign or promotional operations, delivery management or lifecycle marketing, including proven experience leading and developing a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountability for high-volume, time-sensitive operational delivery across multiple channels or workstreams in a complex digital consumer business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on working knowledge of CRM or promotional bonusing platforms (e.g. XtremePush, Braze, Optimove or similar) strong enough to troubleshoot live issues directly and assess technical risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading incident response, on-call governance or escalation frameworks for live activity, with sound operational judgement under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing or improving operational processes, controls, service levels and performance reporting, drawing on workflow management tools (e.g., Airtable, Jira).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent 360° stakeholder management and people leadership, able to influence senior stakeholders across CRM, Product, Compliance, Commercial, Legal, Customer Support and VIP while raising team capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
